# GoCaSE — AI Context Filter
# Prevents the AI from indexing irrelevant files, saving tokens and improving accuracy.

# ── Compiled binaries in root ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.exe
gocase
gocase-test
gocase-server.exe

# ── Go dependency lock file (large, machine-generated) ────────────────────────
go.sum

# ── Uploaded user content (never index user data) ─────────────────────────────
uploads/
storage/uploads/
internal/storage/uploads/

# ── Static assets & screenshots ───────────────────────────────────────────────
assets/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.svg
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.docx

# ── Playwright MCP screenshots ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.playwright-mcp/

# ── Sample/test data files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
sample_tests/
test-upload.json

# ── Git internals ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/

# ── Build outputs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
build/

# ── Notes/playbook reference material (not source code) ──────────────────────
uploads/notes/
